{"version":1,"content":"<p>上周，首個針對任天堂 Switch 2 的越獄漏洞被公開發布到網絡上。儘管這只是一個需要連線（tethered）的漏洞利用方式，但它所打開的可能性依然讓這次發佈令人興奮。幾天之後，這個漏洞已經被投入實際使用：據稱，一名用户解決了該系統的一項關鍵短板，而另一位知名黑客則據稱已經開發出一個非連線式（untethered）漏洞，可能帶來更令人期待的新進展。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1583938.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T14:41:07.705226+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":181,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T14:08:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T14:38:11.022268+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T14:38:11.022268+00:00","content_hash":"ebe68747d790d285da97e8a01ff7724227802f2238070963464ce2d79ceb6d3c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}